WEBVTT

01:18.750 --> 01:21.860
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.980 --> 01:24.900
[Episode 8]

01:28.840 --> 01:29.430
Look—

01:29.920 --> 01:31.430
isn't there someone in white?

01:31.430 --> 01:33.350
I don't know if there's someone
in white outside,

01:33.350 --> 01:35.360
but there is someone in white in the car.

01:35.360 --> 01:37.289
If you sense something behind you,

01:38.360 --> 01:39.440
do not look back.

01:39.470 --> 01:40.530
Haven't you heard?

01:40.940 --> 01:42.729
Every person has 3 fires on their backs.

01:42.729 --> 01:44.090
Each time you look back

01:44.110 --> 01:45.340
just puts out one.

01:45.950 --> 01:47.350
Once all 3 are out,

01:48.660 --> 01:49.720
you'll be done for.

01:53.770 --> 01:54.700
Don't look back.

01:57.250 --> 01:58.450
He's right behind us.

02:15.420 --> 02:22.579
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

02:23.690 --> 02:28.579
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

02:30.230 --> 02:36.320
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

02:37.480 --> 02:43.590
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

02:44.550 --> 02:49.400
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

02:49.970 --> 02:54.240
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

02:54.690 --> 02:59.900
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

02:57.400 --> 02:58.460
What are you doing?

02:58.770 --> 03:01.370
I wanted you to lie down
and sleep comfortably.

03:06.130 --> 03:07.170
Let me take over driving.

03:07.170 --> 03:07.970
You?

03:08.910 --> 03:10.370
Are you sure you can drive?

03:10.560 --> 03:11.630
Are you looking down on me?

03:11.630 --> 03:12.870
I've had my driver's license
since I was 18.

03:12.870 --> 03:13.590
Don't mess around.

03:13.590 --> 03:14.310
Hurry up.

03:14.470 --> 03:15.080
Come on!

03:15.080 --> 03:15.810
No, don't...

03:49.530 --> 03:51.430
What? I have slept for 2 hours?

03:51.460 --> 03:53.110
Didn't I tell you to wake me up
in 15 minutes?

03:53.110 --> 03:53.930
I couldn't wake you up.

03:53.930 --> 03:55.430
You slept like a log.

03:56.380 --> 03:57.579
Brake! Brake! Brake!

04:15.350 --> 04:16.100
What happened?

04:16.100 --> 04:17.700
What happened? You tell me!

04:17.720 --> 04:18.920
Get out of the car now!

04:22.220 --> 04:23.150
It's dangerous!

04:29.900 --> 04:31.640
Do you know what you were doing?

04:33.460 --> 04:34.890
If you hadn't messed
with the steering wheel,

04:34.890 --> 04:36.720
we wouldn't have driven into the mud!

04:36.720 --> 04:38.190
I messed with the steering wheel?
If I hadn't,

04:38.190 --> 04:40.120
you would've driven into the lake!

04:40.330 --> 04:42.260
And you think I was messing with it?

04:46.310 --> 04:47.460
What do we do now?

04:48.820 --> 04:49.890
Let me first try to back the car out.

04:49.890 --> 04:51.090
You go wait out there.

04:51.180 --> 04:52.110
Be careful.

04:55.070 --> 04:56.240
Be careful.

05:39.280 --> 05:41.140
It doesn't seem to work. What now?

05:58.180 --> 05:58.940
It can't get out.

05:58.940 --> 06:00.400
All four wheels are stuck.

06:01.440 --> 06:02.640
What should we do now?

06:13.290 --> 06:14.880
Oh, no, there's no signal at all.

06:14.880 --> 06:16.480
I don't have a signal either.

06:16.750 --> 06:17.940
We're in a mountainous depression.

06:17.940 --> 06:19.540
Of course there's no signal.

06:24.800 --> 06:25.430
Wait here for a second.

06:25.430 --> 06:26.830
I'll go check over there.

06:33.870 --> 06:35.540
Hurry back! I'm scared!

06:36.400 --> 06:37.130
Hurry!

06:44.190 --> 06:45.200
There's nobody here at all.

06:45.200 --> 06:47.530
No way, there's really no one around here.

06:57.310 --> 06:58.040
Are you cold?

07:02.630 --> 07:03.890
Say something.

07:05.750 --> 07:07.350
I just did some calculating.

07:08.070 --> 07:09.430
We passed a village

07:09.430 --> 07:11.090
before the map showed no road.

07:11.510 --> 07:13.560
And then we drove for 19 minutes.

07:14.040 --> 07:14.870
Next,

07:15.360 --> 07:16.600
we hit a 25 km/h speed limit

07:16.600 --> 07:18.130
because of the gravel road.

07:19.190 --> 07:19.720
That means

07:19.720 --> 07:22.390
we're only a dozen kilometers away
from the city.

07:22.390 --> 07:23.190
If we can't

07:23.190 --> 07:24.750
back the car out tonight,

07:24.950 --> 07:26.390
first thing tomorrow morning,

07:26.390 --> 07:27.430
we'll go ask for help.

07:27.430 --> 07:28.290
How about that?

07:30.120 --> 07:31.510
I thought you were frozen in fear.

07:31.510 --> 07:33.800
Never thought
you were calculating all this.

07:33.800 --> 07:34.950
I am scared,

07:35.000 --> 07:36.560
but being scared won't help.

07:36.560 --> 07:37.630
We have to stay composed

07:37.630 --> 07:39.090
and figure out a solution.

07:39.270 --> 07:41.240
Yeah, it's indeed a good idea.

07:42.750 --> 07:44.480
But there's really no one here.

07:44.510 --> 07:45.190
We've got no choice.

07:45.190 --> 07:47.450
But we can't just sit here and do nothing.

07:47.750 --> 07:49.310
We can't keep waiting like this.

07:49.310 --> 07:50.430
Come on, let's move around a bit

07:50.430 --> 07:51.510
in case we freeze.

08:02.330 --> 08:03.560
Come on, get moving!

08:03.580 --> 08:05.230
Your form is wrong.

08:05.430 --> 08:06.520
Then show me the right one.

08:06.520 --> 08:08.050
I'll do one, and you follow.

08:08.390 --> 08:09.000
Go ahead.

08:09.390 --> 08:10.850
Come on, watch carefully.

08:11.890 --> 08:14.400
One, two, three, four.

08:14.480 --> 08:18.140
-Old man, are you doing rehab training?
-Five, six, seven, eight.

09:13.600 --> 09:15.570
I think you've watched
too many soap dramas, huh?

09:15.570 --> 09:16.220
Yes.

09:17.310 --> 09:18.980
That's enough!

09:20.260 --> 09:21.920
I'm tired. I'm going to sleep.

09:58.200 --> 09:59.080
Listen.

10:00.030 --> 10:00.960
There's a sound.

10:03.530 --> 10:04.560
You're so annoying.

10:04.560 --> 10:06.320
That trick doesn't work on me anymore.

10:06.320 --> 10:07.650
There really is a sound!

10:10.730 --> 10:12.420
It sounds like an engine.

10:17.350 --> 10:18.830
It's a tractor! Hurry!

10:28.270 --> 10:29.040
Over here!

10:34.940 --> 10:37.280
Actually, we're not that unlucky.

10:37.560 --> 10:39.720
Someone showed up and helped us
early in the morning,

10:39.720 --> 10:41.360
not only towing the car

10:41.390 --> 10:43.120
but also giving us directions.

10:45.070 --> 10:47.310
That only means I am a lucky star,

10:47.720 --> 10:48.480
you know?

10:48.480 --> 10:49.630
Yeah, yeah.

10:49.870 --> 10:51.130
Just focus on driving.

10:56.620 --> 10:57.340
[Xin You]

10:57.370 --> 10:58.030
[I've uploaded what you want]

10:58.050 --> 10:58.760
[into this link. You were right.
Not everyone in investment banking is]

10:58.790 --> 10:59.470
[a greedy rascal. In the right hands,]

10:59.240 --> 11:00.050
Well...

10:59.490 --> 10:59.970
[this can reveal the truth;]

10:59.990 --> 11:00.630
[in the wrong hands,
this will only make things worse.]

11:00.220 --> 11:01.990
Xin You messaged me.

11:02.870 --> 11:03.730
What did he say?

11:05.510 --> 11:06.960
Stop the car.

11:07.090 --> 11:07.510
What's wrong?

11:07.510 --> 11:09.330
-Pull over. Pull over now.
-Hold on, hold on.

11:09.330 --> 11:10.300
Check this out.

11:10.870 --> 11:11.630
Look what this is.

11:11.630 --> 11:12.520
What? What is it?

11:12.520 --> 11:13.860
Xin You sent me the link

11:13.890 --> 11:16.030
to Shanlifang's original data in Chengdu.

11:16.030 --> 11:16.390
Look, look.

11:16.390 --> 11:17.200
Holy!

11:17.600 --> 11:18.700
This is great!

11:19.200 --> 11:21.010
I told you. He's actually...

11:21.080 --> 11:22.200
We got him wrong.

11:22.270 --> 11:23.410
He's quite a good guy.

11:23.410 --> 11:25.360
Come on, we have a big job to do.

11:25.390 --> 11:26.090
Hurry.

11:27.330 --> 11:28.820
Hard work really paid off.

11:39.840 --> 11:40.720
Are you hungry?

11:43.910 --> 11:45.270
What did you buy?

11:45.790 --> 11:48.030
Since we're here in Chengdu,
I bought some souvenirs.

11:48.030 --> 11:48.890
This is for you.

11:52.080 --> 11:52.720
Broad bean chili sauce?

11:52.720 --> 11:53.120
Did you

11:53.150 --> 11:54.400
buy this gift for me?

11:56.120 --> 11:57.650
Why would I buy this for you?

11:58.200 --> 12:00.120
I got it for free
when I bought something else.

12:00.120 --> 12:01.080
It'd be a pity to throw it away.

12:01.080 --> 12:02.080
So I thought...

12:03.440 --> 12:05.150
Don't you always
make that stir-fried eggplant?

12:05.150 --> 12:06.480
I saw you put this in it.

12:07.360 --> 12:08.400
It's pretty good.

12:08.600 --> 12:10.330
Just make more. I love it.

12:11.870 --> 12:14.470
What did you buy
to get so many bottles for free?

12:14.840 --> 12:17.040
You didn't buy it for yourself, did you?

12:17.240 --> 12:18.670
Forget it if you don't want it.

12:18.670 --> 12:20.240
You said I could order whatever I want.

12:20.240 --> 12:21.120
Just throw it away.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.480
I never said I didn't want it.

12:22.480 --> 12:24.480
It'd be such a waste to throw it away.

12:25.440 --> 12:27.720
Then shouldn't you formally add

12:27.870 --> 12:30.270
an extra pair of chopsticks
for me tonight?

12:30.480 --> 12:31.930
You promised me that

12:31.960 --> 12:33.320
you'd make me those extra dishes,

12:33.320 --> 12:34.790
but you haven't made them yet.

12:34.790 --> 12:36.030
What extra dishes?

12:36.080 --> 12:37.870
Director Fang hasn't agreed
to my reinstatement yet.

12:37.870 --> 12:39.120
There's nothing to celebrate.

12:39.120 --> 12:42.380
We'll have something to celebrate
when we go back tonight.

12:43.480 --> 12:44.660
Forget it.

12:46.750 --> 12:49.200
I don't want to get my hopes up too high.

12:49.320 --> 12:51.650
The higher the hopes, the harder the fall.

12:51.720 --> 12:53.320
I'll just try my best anyway.

12:53.720 --> 12:54.550
No!

12:55.150 --> 12:56.150
No what?

12:56.840 --> 12:57.510
Listen,

12:57.510 --> 12:59.240
I'm definitely having those dishes.

12:59.240 --> 13:01.150
We've been to Chengdu
and Peach Blossom Village.

13:01.150 --> 13:03.080
What's stopping us
from dreaming big?

13:03.080 --> 13:04.150
The data we risked our lives to get

13:04.150 --> 13:05.440
can't even impress a...

13:05.440 --> 13:06.770
a-a director in He Jing?

13:07.390 --> 13:08.590
Just watch!

13:09.150 --> 13:11.500
It will shake the whole Shanlifang!

13:11.600 --> 13:13.190
Why are you so excited?

13:13.270 --> 13:14.390
Will you cook or not?

13:14.390 --> 13:15.150
I promise you.

13:15.150 --> 13:15.910
I'll set a pair of chopsticks

13:15.910 --> 13:17.670
for you whether I get reinstated
or not, okay?

13:17.670 --> 13:18.750
So embarrassing.

13:20.910 --> 13:22.200
What exactly did you buy to get

13:22.200 --> 13:22.750
so many freebies?

13:22.750 --> 13:24.350
Take me to have a look. Hurry.

13:26.150 --> 13:27.150
None of your business.

13:27.150 --> 13:28.840
Buy 1 and get 9 free. Got a problem?

13:28.840 --> 13:30.030
Show-off.

13:34.750 --> 13:35.900
Hello, Mr. Jiang.

13:38.750 --> 13:39.480
What?

13:42.720 --> 13:43.740
I'll arrive in Shanghai soon.

13:43.740 --> 13:45.470
I'll send you my flight number.

13:46.150 --> 13:46.750
Okay.

13:49.240 --> 13:50.080
What's wrong?

13:53.890 --> 13:54.950
My dad got injured.

13:57.120 --> 13:58.030
Is it serious?

13:58.480 --> 13:59.320
I don't know.

14:02.790 --> 14:04.200
Don't worry too much.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.460
He will surely be fine.

14:48.800 --> 14:50.460
I didn't say you could eat yet.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.570
You can't eat until I say so.

14:52.570 --> 14:53.230
Got it?

14:53.380 --> 14:54.160
Come on, eat!

14:55.840 --> 14:56.550
Good boy.

14:56.550 --> 14:57.150
Come on.

14:58.440 --> 14:59.470
Come here, Furry.

14:59.630 --> 15:00.600
Furry.

15:03.840 --> 15:04.540
Come here.

15:04.870 --> 15:05.510
Furry.

15:08.320 --> 15:09.510
There you go.

15:10.760 --> 15:11.780
Old man.

15:12.790 --> 15:14.320
Are you out of your mind?

15:14.480 --> 15:16.200
You used this trick
to get me to come home?

15:16.200 --> 15:17.500
Aren't you childish?

15:18.000 --> 15:18.870
Go play by yourself.

15:18.870 --> 15:19.810
No, no.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.540
Yifei, I didn't lie to you.

15:22.200 --> 15:23.400
I really got injured.

15:23.670 --> 15:24.930
Where did you get hurt?

15:25.510 --> 15:26.640
I sprained my ankle.

15:26.910 --> 15:28.750
I w-was walking him, and I just

15:28.750 --> 15:29.810
sprained my ankle.

15:31.150 --> 15:32.480
And this is what Mr. Jiang called

15:32.480 --> 15:34.810
a serious injury that left you bedridden?

15:35.360 --> 15:36.200
Jiang

15:36.200 --> 15:38.600
always exaggerates things.

15:38.620 --> 15:39.480
It's not that serious.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.920
But I did get hurt.

15:42.910 --> 15:43.790
Are you okay now?

15:43.790 --> 15:44.440
Yes.

15:44.840 --> 15:46.370
Alright, I'm leaving then.

15:48.200 --> 15:49.200
I haven't finished talking yet,

15:49.200 --> 15:50.170
and you're leaving?

15:50.170 --> 15:51.480
I'm very busy.

15:51.510 --> 15:53.050
If you're okay, I'll really get going.

15:53.050 --> 15:54.170
Who said I'm fine?

15:54.200 --> 15:56.000
Did you even give me time to talk?

15:57.360 --> 15:57.910
Fine, fine.

15:57.910 --> 15:58.700
Yifei.

15:59.750 --> 16:01.000
You haven't been home for a long time.

16:01.000 --> 16:02.460
Stay for dinner this time.

16:02.480 --> 16:03.050
Furry!

16:06.960 --> 16:07.650
Come here.

16:07.960 --> 16:09.690
Go, go find your older brother.

16:10.480 --> 16:12.320
Don't call me "old man" next time.

16:12.320 --> 16:13.380
Am I that old?

16:59.000 --> 17:01.060
It's no different from eating alone.

17:03.880 --> 17:05.680
You don't even say a single word.

17:08.790 --> 17:11.119
Isn't this the rule you set
when I was a kid?

17:11.430 --> 17:13.680
No talking during meals, right?

17:13.700 --> 17:15.390
No, only you can talk.

17:19.880 --> 17:21.450
Actually, you can talk.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.319
It's fine. I'm used to it.

17:24.329 --> 17:25.990
How is it? Are you busy lately?

17:26.920 --> 17:27.550
Busy.

17:28.310 --> 17:29.310
Busy with everything.

17:29.310 --> 17:30.440
Pretty busy anyway.

17:32.160 --> 17:34.610
You're just messing around,

17:34.640 --> 17:35.940
wasting your time.

17:36.920 --> 17:37.920
Yes.

17:38.030 --> 17:39.700
Compared to your big business,

17:39.700 --> 17:40.900
everything I do is like messing around,

17:40.900 --> 17:42.760
and everything is a waste of time.

17:47.350 --> 17:49.410
Let's talk about something serious.

17:49.550 --> 17:51.260
Since you

17:51.920 --> 17:53.320
care about me so much,

17:53.510 --> 17:54.540
I've decided

17:55.160 --> 17:57.390
to invest a bit in your company.

17:59.830 --> 18:00.490
How's that?

18:00.720 --> 18:01.720
No, please don't.

18:02.680 --> 18:04.180
When it comes to investment,

18:04.180 --> 18:05.920
you either think highly of the project

18:05.920 --> 18:07.830
or expect future returns.

18:07.960 --> 18:10.160
You're making it look like charity,

18:10.550 --> 18:12.270
with strings attached—

18:12.750 --> 18:13.610
just forget it.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.650
I don't have any strings attached.

18:15.900 --> 18:16.760
No?

18:17.200 --> 18:20.000
Don't you just want me to come back
and work for you?

18:21.160 --> 18:23.640
Is working for me a string attached?

18:23.920 --> 18:25.920
Isn't it what you're supposed to do?

18:27.640 --> 18:28.540
Besides,

18:28.680 --> 18:30.030
it won't stop you from running

18:30.030 --> 18:31.370
your...

18:32.110 --> 18:34.530
What's it called? Lashit or something?

18:34.720 --> 18:36.000
What Lashit?

18:36.110 --> 18:37.200
It's Fulaxida.

18:37.390 --> 18:39.000
Fulaxida!

18:39.200 --> 18:40.510
Fulaxida.

18:41.000 --> 18:42.470
It doesn't conflict.

18:42.720 --> 18:43.850
Just think about it.

18:44.680 --> 18:47.200
You help me run Qiansheng,

18:47.670 --> 18:50.880
and I'll bankroll your Fulaxida.

18:51.720 --> 18:54.280
We can handle both of them together.

18:54.380 --> 18:55.990
Chairman Li, I don't need it,

18:56.590 --> 18:57.250
seriously.

18:59.560 --> 19:01.740
Why are you so stubborn?

19:02.440 --> 19:03.670
Listen.

19:04.440 --> 19:06.690
I can't bear to see my son's company

19:07.010 --> 19:08.940
get crushed by others.

19:11.070 --> 19:12.640
What do you mean by "get crushed"?

19:12.640 --> 19:14.030
What are you talking about?

19:14.030 --> 19:15.690
Don't tell me you have no idea.

19:16.140 --> 19:19.400
I heard someone tried
to poach your staff with high salaries.

19:19.400 --> 19:22.130
Your company's executives are
already tempted.

19:26.110 --> 19:27.020
Who did this?

19:27.680 --> 19:28.820
Who else could it be?

19:29.900 --> 19:31.700
That old guy, Liao.

19:35.790 --> 19:38.690
Aren't you helping him go public?

19:38.960 --> 19:40.820
Why is he still going against you?

19:41.790 --> 19:43.310
How did you know about this?

19:43.310 --> 19:44.640
Isn't it self-evident?

19:45.150 --> 19:47.010
It's the business chosen by my son.

19:47.010 --> 19:48.740
How could I not keep an eye on it?

19:49.960 --> 19:50.590
Yeah,

19:50.750 --> 19:52.030
I see.

19:52.110 --> 19:53.690
So you really care about me.

19:54.030 --> 19:56.970
Anyway, I'm the only one allowed
to pressure my son—

19:57.030 --> 19:58.450
no one else can.

20:01.310 --> 20:02.040
Chairman Li,

20:02.680 --> 20:04.010
I really appreciate it.

20:04.720 --> 20:05.270
Look.

20:05.350 --> 20:06.830
I can handle the matter

20:06.830 --> 20:08.360
with Chairman Liao myself.

20:08.400 --> 20:10.510
Fulaxida is not short of money either.

20:10.510 --> 20:12.040
So don't worry about it.

20:12.110 --> 20:13.110
Just take good care of Furry

20:13.110 --> 20:15.400
and run your Qiansheng Manufacturing well.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.130
What's more,

20:16.480 --> 20:18.200
don't always try to get me to come
and have fun with you.

20:18.200 --> 20:19.030
I'm very busy.

20:19.110 --> 20:20.820
You've got a big business,
but I haven't gotten there yet.

20:20.820 --> 20:22.350
I haven't even settled down, you know?

20:22.350 --> 20:23.310
Wait a minute.

20:24.550 --> 20:26.080
Speaking of settling down,

20:27.070 --> 20:28.930
when are you going to get married?

20:29.000 --> 20:30.240
Are you with that Gui Lili...

20:30.240 --> 20:30.790
Alright, alright,

20:30.790 --> 20:32.610
stop playing dumb with me.

20:33.110 --> 20:34.400
Didn't your paparazzi report it to you?

20:34.400 --> 20:35.660
I already broke up with Gui Lili.

20:35.660 --> 20:36.790
Don't you know that?

20:38.270 --> 20:39.590
Tell me what happened.

20:39.830 --> 20:40.530
Stop.

20:40.750 --> 20:41.590
Don't be sarcastic.

20:41.590 --> 20:43.320
I know what you're going to say.

20:45.810 --> 20:46.690
Look at you.

20:46.920 --> 20:48.980
Old man, let's talk about something.

20:49.200 --> 20:52.060
Stop paying too much attention
to my personal life.

20:52.310 --> 20:54.310
Can I talk about something with you, too?

20:54.310 --> 20:56.570
Can you please stop calling me "old man"?

20:56.680 --> 20:58.940
Have you ever seen such a young "old man"?

20:59.260 --> 21:00.460
All right, all right.

21:01.070 --> 21:02.400
You are young. You are young.

21:02.400 --> 21:03.030
Exactly.

21:03.680 --> 21:04.920
I'm full, young old man.

21:04.920 --> 21:05.830
I'll get going.

21:06.750 --> 21:07.550
You know what?

21:08.100 --> 21:10.240
Breaking up with Gui Lili was
the right thing to do.

21:10.240 --> 21:13.300
Next time, bring someone back
who's suitable to marry.

21:14.510 --> 21:15.310
This is yours?

21:17.160 --> 21:18.680
How can you finish such a big package?

21:18.680 --> 21:20.080
I'll help you consume it.

21:20.640 --> 21:22.960
It's top-grade Da Hong Pao.
Use 100°C water for it.

21:22.960 --> 21:23.590
Got it.

21:26.440 --> 21:28.500
I thought you didn't like tea.

21:33.400 --> 21:34.070
Mr. Jiang.

21:34.640 --> 21:35.400
Yifei,

21:35.590 --> 21:37.390
you didn't drive here this time?

21:37.440 --> 21:38.520
I mortgaged it.

21:39.070 --> 21:40.710
That's so inconvenient.

21:40.790 --> 21:41.900
Go pick one from the garage.

21:41.900 --> 21:42.500
No need.

21:42.530 --> 21:43.860
I'm a young guy
who sold his house to start a business.

21:43.860 --> 21:45.640
It's not appropriate for me
to drive a luxury car.

21:45.640 --> 21:46.200
I'm off.

21:47.540 --> 21:48.870
By the way, Mr. Jiang...

21:50.000 --> 21:51.400
Mr. Jiang, I remember you have

21:51.400 --> 21:52.440
a Polo, right?

21:54.070 --> 21:55.160
Lend it to me, come on.

21:55.160 --> 21:57.490
I'll have my dad
get you a bigger one later.

21:58.070 --> 21:58.640
Okay.

21:59.110 --> 22:00.710
Only you could think of that.

22:00.920 --> 22:01.750
Fine, take it.

22:10.150 --> 22:13.440
[Chairman Liao Jinshan's
60th Birthday Party]

22:17.030 --> 22:18.050
This is today's menu.

22:18.050 --> 22:19.110
Please take a look.

22:20.210 --> 22:22.000
[Chairman Liao Jinshan's
60th Birthday Party]

22:22.000 --> 22:23.510
[Check-in Desk]

22:22.200 --> 22:23.990
Several of these dishes are too similar.

22:23.990 --> 22:25.120
What's going on?

22:26.270 --> 22:27.870
Hello, Vice President Liao.

22:28.240 --> 22:28.920
Shiyu.

22:29.000 --> 22:29.610
Dad,

22:29.830 --> 22:31.400
why are you here so early?

22:31.480 --> 22:32.730
It's still early
before the banquet begins.

22:32.730 --> 22:34.130
I just came to take a look.

22:34.810 --> 22:36.110
I'm handling everything here.

22:36.110 --> 22:37.710
What's there to worry about?

22:37.780 --> 22:39.170
I was just born to toil.

22:39.200 --> 22:40.060
I can't help it.

22:40.510 --> 22:41.840
You may get back to work.

22:43.040 --> 22:43.970
Were these

22:45.400 --> 22:46.600
all picked by you?

22:47.880 --> 22:50.350
I carefully selected
every single dish myself.

22:50.350 --> 22:51.350
What do you think?

22:51.400 --> 22:52.460
Are you satisfied?

22:52.830 --> 22:54.510
Daughter, you're always careful

22:54.510 --> 22:56.510
and thoughtful when handling things.

22:56.510 --> 22:58.110
How could I not rest assured?

23:01.000 --> 23:02.720
But it's good that you came early.

23:02.720 --> 23:04.380
You can chat with Ruohai more.

23:06.270 --> 23:07.400
"Ruohai"?

23:08.400 --> 23:10.800
You're calling him so affectionately now?

23:11.090 --> 23:12.060
Dad!

23:14.750 --> 23:15.460
Ruohai.

23:16.690 --> 23:17.690
Hello, Chairman.

23:19.200 --> 23:19.830
What is it?

23:21.180 --> 23:21.790
Ruohai,

23:22.030 --> 23:24.030
didn't you prepare a gift for my dad?

23:25.830 --> 23:26.880
Just a small gift

23:27.440 --> 23:29.200
to wish you a happy birthday, Chairman.

23:29.200 --> 23:29.740
Dad,

23:29.880 --> 23:31.180
Ruohai had someone specially

23:31.180 --> 23:33.110
custom-make this for you in Italy.

23:34.830 --> 23:36.010
Open it and take a look.

23:36.010 --> 23:38.120
You must've put a lot of thought into it.

23:38.120 --> 23:38.720
Let's see.

23:38.750 --> 23:39.400
Let me see.

23:46.590 --> 23:48.060
Why is there only one?

23:48.550 --> 23:49.880
It's a golf glove.

23:50.000 --> 23:51.530
You're supposed to use one.

23:54.270 --> 23:55.210
Do you like it?

23:55.670 --> 23:56.470
Try it on.

23:59.000 --> 24:00.080
It's a perfect fit.

24:00.110 --> 24:01.170
It fits just right.

24:10.160 --> 24:12.160
Miss Liao, the cake is here already.

24:12.720 --> 24:13.260
Okay.

24:13.880 --> 24:15.210
I'm going to take a look.

24:23.890 --> 24:26.210
I'm a simple man with few desires.

24:27.280 --> 24:28.470
At my age,

24:29.350 --> 24:30.720
I don't care about

24:31.000 --> 24:32.400
money or status anymore.

24:32.680 --> 24:34.680
Sincerity is the only thing I value.

24:36.180 --> 24:39.440
Since you lacked the sincerity
to pick a birthday gift in person,

24:39.440 --> 24:41.100
why did you bother giving one?

24:44.440 --> 24:45.640
I'm sorry, Chairman.

24:46.830 --> 24:48.090
It won't happen again.

24:49.480 --> 24:50.180
Remember,

24:51.270 --> 24:52.440
you can lie to me.

24:53.000 --> 24:53.960
But if one day,

24:54.830 --> 24:57.160
I find out you've deceived my daughter...

25:03.000 --> 25:04.030
I mean if.

25:18.680 --> 25:19.350
I'm back.

25:22.720 --> 25:25.650
Well, how is your father doing?
Is he feeling better?

25:26.550 --> 25:28.510
-Um, don't worry too much.
-My dad...

25:28.510 --> 25:29.640
Old people just tend

25:29.640 --> 25:30.640
to have minor health issues.

25:30.640 --> 25:31.700
It's quite normal.

25:33.510 --> 25:35.280
I made you some white fungus soup.

25:35.280 --> 25:36.040
Have some.

25:36.070 --> 25:38.410
If you get anxious,
you can't take good care of your family.

25:38.410 --> 25:39.070
Have a seat.

25:50.710 --> 25:52.040
Drink it while it's hot.

25:56.920 --> 25:57.720
Thank you.

25:58.920 --> 25:59.920
Don't mention it.

26:06.880 --> 26:07.460
Well,

26:07.640 --> 26:08.840
enjoy your soup.

26:08.960 --> 26:11.090
Get some good rest after you finish it.

26:12.830 --> 26:13.410
Thanks.

26:13.480 --> 26:14.100
It's okay.

26:21.030 --> 26:21.890
So comforting.

26:32.480 --> 26:33.520
It feels so good.

26:34.440 --> 26:35.250
It's so good.

26:37.510 --> 26:39.710
Someone even made me white fungus soup.

26:50.510 --> 26:53.090
Oh, right, my dad said that in a few days,

26:53.110 --> 26:55.030
he will assign you an important task.

26:55.030 --> 26:55.990
What is it?

26:57.790 --> 27:00.190
I think it's something about going public.

27:02.520 --> 27:04.380
Don't be nervous. I will help you.

27:09.200 --> 27:11.270
The fact that my dad is entrusting
such an important task to you

27:11.270 --> 27:12.920
means he already trusts you

27:13.200 --> 27:15.230
and will start to make you
do weighty jobs.

27:15.230 --> 27:16.490
You should be happy.

28:28.750 --> 28:29.580
Almost done.

28:58.310 --> 28:59.070
Landlady.

29:01.680 --> 29:02.400
Landlady?

29:04.880 --> 29:05.610
Where is she?

29:07.640 --> 29:08.550
I'm starving.

29:21.310 --> 29:22.510
Yangzhou fried rice?

29:57.050 --> 29:58.680
[Comprehensive Research Report
of the Shanlifang Hotel]

29:58.700 --> 30:01.060
[Solidifying the Industrial Layout
While Awaiting the Right IPO Window]

30:10.030 --> 30:10.750
Not bad.

30:13.400 --> 30:14.800
She pulled it off so fast.

30:50.590 --> 30:52.400
So he was in the mood to eat.

30:52.960 --> 30:54.590
Seems like he's fine now.

31:03.350 --> 31:05.210
How dare he touch my document?

31:07.290 --> 31:08.500
[I didn't eat your fried rice for free.
As your teacher, I helped you]

31:08.520 --> 31:09.840
[improve your document.
Consider it my payment for the meal.]

31:23.160 --> 31:24.790
This man...

31:24.440 --> 31:27.400
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

31:25.750 --> 31:28.400
He might have a bad temper in daily life,

31:28.380 --> 31:31.910
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

31:29.720 --> 31:32.330
but professionally, he's really something.

31:32.920 --> 31:34.330
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

31:34.000 --> 31:35.350
Alright, it's ready to be sent.

31:34.820 --> 31:36.520
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

31:36.810 --> 31:38.840
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

31:39.570 --> 31:41.220
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

31:39.800 --> 31:41.850
[Research Report
on Chengdu Shanlifang Hotel]

31:41.690 --> 31:45.390
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

31:41.880 --> 31:43.760
[Sending email]

31:43.780 --> 31:43.990
[Successfully sent]

31:45.590 --> 31:46.960
It's all done.

31:46.220 --> 31:49.690
♪ You always easily arouse my desire
to protect you ♪

31:49.260 --> 31:53.390
[Line 12]

31:50.580 --> 31:51.830
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

31:52.520 --> 31:54.050
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

31:54.620 --> 31:56.730
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

31:57.280 --> 31:58.460
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

31:58.120 --> 31:59.350
Your revisions are not bad.

31:59.350 --> 32:00.220
Thank you.

32:08.220 --> 32:11.830
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

32:10.310 --> 32:12.120
Only a verbal thank you?

32:12.620 --> 32:16.030
♪ You always easily arouse my desire
to protect you ♪

32:16.850 --> 32:18.190
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

32:18.440 --> 32:20.720
Wasn't the fried rice already a thank you?

32:18.770 --> 32:20.330
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

32:20.900 --> 32:23.020
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

32:23.650 --> 32:25.150
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

32:25.570 --> 32:29.270
♪ Why is it you again?
In such a sweet tone ♪

32:26.440 --> 32:28.200
I want to have some tea eggs,

32:28.310 --> 32:30.470
with the same flavor as the ones
you put in the fridge last time.

32:29.760 --> 32:33.710
♪ It's like the whole world knows
I miss you ♪

32:32.110 --> 32:33.230
So that's why!

32:33.350 --> 32:35.510
I was wondering
why they only lasted two meals.

32:34.580 --> 32:38.020
♪ Why is it always you?
With a cool chuckle ♪

32:35.510 --> 32:37.000
So you secretly ate them.

32:37.640 --> 32:38.650
There is no tea at home.

32:38.650 --> 32:42.470
♪ Let me play along and protect you ♪

32:39.400 --> 32:41.810
I brought a box back. It's by the door.

32:42.200 --> 32:43.550
There are no eggs.

32:42.940 --> 32:46.640
♪ Why is it always you,
with that smile on your lips ♪

32:43.790 --> 32:46.650
I got a box of them delivered.
They're in the fridge.

32:46.960 --> 32:47.730
You win.

32:47.180 --> 32:50.990
♪ I blurt out I like you,
and I only like you ♪

33:08.160 --> 33:09.590
Li Yifei just likes this kind

33:09.590 --> 33:11.000
of flashy but useless stuff.

33:11.000 --> 33:12.210
"Da Hong Pao," huh?

33:12.310 --> 33:14.370
How could there be so much Da Hong Pao?

33:14.750 --> 33:16.150
It's all just packaging.

33:17.620 --> 33:21.290
[Da Hong Pao]

33:48.480 --> 33:49.410
It smells great.

34:11.000 --> 34:12.510
This tea smells so great.

34:18.630 --> 34:19.889
Say something.

34:20.030 --> 34:22.230
Is this tea of yours the real Da Hong Pao?

34:24.280 --> 34:26.080
It is Da Hong Pao.

34:27.760 --> 34:30.150
Stop knocking.
I want to sleep a bit longer.

34:30.150 --> 34:31.860
What a waste of the precious.

34:32.030 --> 34:33.590
If I knew it, I would sell it

34:33.840 --> 34:35.230
and buy you some common tea leaves

34:35.230 --> 34:36.260
to make tea eggs.

34:40.070 --> 34:41.440
In this case,

34:42.590 --> 34:45.659
let me just take a photo with the tea egg

34:45.690 --> 34:46.960
I made.

35:36.190 --> 35:38.790
The landlady really has
great cooking skills.

35:48.480 --> 35:49.250
Not bad.

36:18.230 --> 36:19.090
Director Fang.

36:21.360 --> 36:22.420
Are you free later?

36:22.550 --> 36:24.440
Would you like to come to my office
for a drink?

36:24.440 --> 36:25.030
Okay.

36:25.760 --> 36:26.520
Please.

36:27.920 --> 36:29.000
Wait for me here.

36:33.230 --> 36:34.630
Come on, this way please.

36:36.230 --> 36:37.230
Here's your coffee.

36:37.230 --> 36:37.830
Okay.

36:40.110 --> 36:41.310
Close the door for me.

36:45.960 --> 36:48.400
Director Fang,
through our cooperation this time,

36:48.400 --> 36:50.520
I have truly found in you

36:50.540 --> 36:52.320
what real professionalism is.

36:53.510 --> 36:55.880
In the competition
for Shanlifang's lead underwriting before,

36:55.880 --> 36:57.050
I lost to you.

36:57.320 --> 36:58.850
I concede wholeheartedly.

36:58.880 --> 37:01.000
President Li,
please just cut to the chase.

37:01.000 --> 37:03.460
Let's skip flattering each other,
shall we?

37:03.710 --> 37:05.000
President Li, you wouldn't waste time

37:05.000 --> 37:06.840
just to treat a guest to coffee, huh?

37:06.840 --> 37:07.900
Yes, you're right.

37:08.150 --> 37:10.190
Alright, let's be straightforward.

37:10.190 --> 37:12.050
I won't beat around the bush then.

37:12.070 --> 37:13.270
At the meeting today,

37:13.280 --> 37:16.440
I noticed that you hesitated
to speak several times, Director Fang.

37:16.440 --> 37:18.670
You must've been
holding something back, I think.

37:18.670 --> 37:20.560
So, I hope we can sit down

37:20.660 --> 37:22.520
and have an open and honest talk.

37:23.070 --> 37:24.070
What do you think?

37:24.110 --> 37:26.640
I think you held back
even more, President Li.

37:27.070 --> 37:29.000
You've been to Chengdu a while ago?

37:29.150 --> 37:30.680
Were you going on vacation?

37:32.320 --> 37:34.920
You certainly know a lot
about my whereabouts.

37:35.030 --> 37:36.460
Disappearing in the middle of a meeting

37:36.460 --> 37:38.030
was such an abnormal behavior.

37:38.030 --> 37:39.960
How could I not pay attention to it?

37:46.670 --> 37:47.530
So

37:48.070 --> 37:49.670
how was your trip to Chengdu?

37:51.480 --> 37:53.380
You also received

37:54.480 --> 37:56.680
the investigation report, didn't you?

38:02.070 --> 38:03.150
So that's how it is.

38:04.150 --> 38:06.590
I was wondering how that little girl,
Qian Fei,

38:06.590 --> 38:08.010
could be so capable

38:08.070 --> 38:09.800
and dig up so much information.

38:10.150 --> 38:11.920
Turns out she's got someone backing her.

38:11.920 --> 38:13.450
You are wrong about that.

38:14.000 --> 38:14.760
The two of us

38:14.760 --> 38:16.220
really just bumped into each other

38:16.220 --> 38:17.750
during our investigation.

38:17.920 --> 38:20.050
And neither of us is backing the other.

38:20.630 --> 38:22.830
This is the result of our joint efforts.

38:23.630 --> 38:25.360
Did you know each other before?

38:27.030 --> 38:28.290
You could say that.

38:28.310 --> 38:30.030
This girl once caused me

38:30.050 --> 38:32.910
to almost miss
the submission of the bid documents.

38:33.150 --> 38:34.130
I have to say,

38:34.150 --> 38:36.190
the employee
trained by you, Director Fang,

38:36.190 --> 38:37.590
is quite extraordinary.

38:37.800 --> 38:40.490
She stopped being part
of He Jing a long time ago.

38:40.840 --> 38:41.770
Is that so?

38:42.360 --> 38:44.180
But she told me

38:45.150 --> 38:47.360
that you really wanted her
to join the project team

38:47.360 --> 38:49.320
and that you were the one who inspired her

38:49.320 --> 38:51.650
to go to Chengdu
to find the original data.

38:51.710 --> 38:52.680
I think

38:53.030 --> 38:55.360
she might have misunderstood something.

38:59.480 --> 39:01.040
Be it a misunderstanding or not,

39:01.040 --> 39:02.920
I feel that this girl

39:03.230 --> 39:04.490
has a lot of potential.

39:05.230 --> 39:05.910
Is that so?

39:07.120 --> 39:09.550
Let me just take
this Chengdu trip as an example.

39:09.550 --> 39:11.550
Instead of saying that I helped her,

39:11.710 --> 39:12.880
it was more like

39:13.440 --> 39:14.440
she did me a favor.

39:15.190 --> 39:17.030
Since she's such an outstanding talent,

39:17.030 --> 39:19.290
why don't you recruit her, President Li?

39:19.440 --> 39:20.920
I wanted to,

39:21.070 --> 39:22.620
but she's not interested.

39:23.150 --> 39:24.510
She has absolutely no interest

39:24.510 --> 39:26.000
in Zhizhong Investment.

39:26.590 --> 39:27.410
This girl is

39:27.590 --> 39:30.330
determined to work for you, Director Fang.

39:32.640 --> 39:34.000
So you only bought me coffee

39:34.000 --> 39:35.790
to speak up for Qian Fei.

39:36.800 --> 39:37.840
Not exactly.

39:39.550 --> 39:40.640
As for Qian Fei,

39:40.660 --> 39:43.190
didn't you bring her up first,
Director Fang?

39:44.160 --> 39:46.470
I want to talk about...

39:47.070 --> 39:48.800
About Shanlifang's accounts.

39:52.360 --> 39:54.620
Since we've both found something wrong,

39:55.190 --> 39:57.360
we can't pretend to know nothing about it,

39:57.360 --> 39:58.120
right?

39:59.510 --> 40:00.120
Yes.

40:01.700 --> 40:03.900
Then President Li, do you have any idea?

40:04.030 --> 40:05.960
We should lay everything
out on the table, of course.

40:05.960 --> 40:08.090
Otherwise, we'll be breaking the law.

40:09.000 --> 40:09.880
Yeah.

40:10.610 --> 40:11.880
But if we do this,

40:12.320 --> 40:14.190
I'll feel sorry for Qian Fei.

40:15.880 --> 40:17.000
What do you mean?

40:18.280 --> 40:21.150
Think about it.
You know Chairman Liao's temper.

40:21.280 --> 40:22.920
If we lay everything out on the table,

40:22.920 --> 40:25.820
he might not terminate
the contract with He Jing immediately,

40:25.820 --> 40:28.390
but he will definitely take it out
on Qian Fei.

40:28.510 --> 40:29.650
In this case...

40:29.680 --> 40:31.710
Qian Fei did everything
in order to get reinstated.

40:31.710 --> 40:32.440
I know that.

40:33.110 --> 40:34.230
But what about the result?

40:34.230 --> 40:35.830
Won't it be too unfair to her?

40:35.920 --> 40:36.780
But I

40:37.190 --> 40:39.140
go up against the Chairman, right?

40:39.280 --> 40:40.210
I can't force it.

40:40.230 --> 40:41.550
I can't protect her.

40:43.920 --> 40:44.510
I see.

40:48.670 --> 40:49.800
Then how about this?

40:51.280 --> 40:52.680
I will lay everything out

40:53.960 --> 40:55.160
on the table on my own.

40:56.360 --> 40:57.450
He Jing

40:58.230 --> 41:01.440
can pretend to know nothing about this.

41:02.420 --> 41:03.620
What's your opinion?

41:03.980 --> 41:04.500
No.

41:06.070 --> 41:08.880
Not standing
with Zhizhong Investment through this

41:08.880 --> 41:09.610
is not right.

41:09.710 --> 41:11.210
I can't bear to do that.

41:11.360 --> 41:11.880
I see.

41:14.230 --> 41:15.400
I think

41:15.510 --> 41:18.760
forcing Shanlifang to cooperate
with a re-audit

41:18.790 --> 41:20.400
is our shared goal.

41:21.030 --> 41:23.930
As for who will end up
being the sacrifice,

41:24.190 --> 41:25.250
it doesn't matter.

41:32.150 --> 41:32.900
All right.

41:34.360 --> 41:35.760
Thank you, President Li.

41:47.130 --> 41:53.550
[Zhizhong Construction Investment
Securities Co., Ltd]

41:53.840 --> 41:54.570
Cui.

41:55.760 --> 41:57.230
Contact the HR department.

41:57.230 --> 41:57.840
Okay.

42:21.150 --> 42:22.550
So it was just a dream.

42:23.320 --> 42:24.580
I knew it.

42:25.630 --> 42:27.560
Good things only happen in dreams.

42:33.920 --> 42:35.710
So many missed calls?

42:34.110 --> 42:35.850
[Missed Calls]

42:45.320 --> 42:45.880
Hello?

42:46.230 --> 42:48.040
Hello, Yu. You called me?

42:48.070 --> 42:48.870
I just woke up.

42:49.190 --> 42:51.450
Girl, I can't believe you were sleeping.

42:52.140 --> 42:53.760
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.440 --> 42:55.250
Qian Fei!

42:59.290 --> 43:00.550
You must be overjoyed.

43:00.560 --> 43:02.550
I was transferred out, so you could join.

43:02.550 --> 43:04.080
What are you talking about?

43:04.150 --> 43:05.150
Stop pretending.

43:05.220 --> 43:06.880
Isn't this all because of you?

43:07.630 --> 43:10.240
Did you really fall for your landlady?

43:11.840 --> 43:13.240
With my standards,

43:13.490 --> 43:14.820
how would I fall for her?

43:15.110 --> 43:16.640
I have another question for you.

43:16.640 --> 43:18.470
One question for one meal.

43:18.560 --> 43:19.480
I can cook.

43:19.920 --> 43:21.250
But do you dare to eat it?

43:21.400 --> 43:22.230
What do you mean?
